# "… this way": the event the enclosing ability's earlier text caused [CR#608.2c]. It is no
# linking phrase [CR#607.1], so it reads only the current ability's stamps; a Participial
# Description that reaches a linked ability's objects [CR#607.2a] omits `within`.
primitive thisWay: LookbackSpan = ThisWay {
  spelling = "this way"
}
